[0, "o", "\u001b[2J\u001b[HMokioAgent | 完整交付\nD01-full-1\n这是已归档记录的回放，不是一次新的实时模型运行。\n\n"]
[12, "o", "\u001b[2J\u001b[H需求与来源\n修复 src/batch_queue.py 的 take_batch(items, limit)。\nitems 是可变列表，limit 是整数。要求按 FIFO 顺序移除并返回至多 limit 项，\n列表中剩余项的顺序不变；limit=0 时返回空列表且不消费；limit<0 时抛出\nValueError，不能改变原列表（包括空列表）。保留正常排空与空队列行为。\n只修改实现，运行可见测试并自行检查这些边界，再汇报修改和实际验证结果。\n可见测试命令：PYTHONPATH=src:. python -m pytest -q。\n这是受控的小任务演示，不属于 internship-v1 的 12 任务或架构对照成绩。\n\nbase: controlled-fixture-2afb0ae10f19d3d3c7d4e3a85b65b100e2254a2c32339baaf3c5e0db5217663c\n"]
[32, "o", "\u001b[2J\u001b[H仓库证据（checkpoint 摘要）\n{\"summary\": \"I have the full picture. Here is the read-only analysis and the planned change.\\n\\n```json\\n{\\n  \\\"summary\\\": \\\"src/batch_queue.py contains a single 6-line function take_batch(items, limit) that pops from the front of a mutable list. The current loop condition `len(batch) <= limit` is off-by-one (returns limit+1 items), and there is no validation of limit, so limit=0 consumes one item and limit<0 consumes items instead of raising ValueError. The fix is a small, self-contained rewrite of the function body only: validate limit first (before any mutation), then slice off at most `limit` items with `del items[:n]` to preserve FIFO order and the order of remaining items.\\\",\\n  \\\"entry_points\\\": [\\n    {\\\"file\\\": \\\"src/batch_queue.py\\\", \\\"line\\\": 1, \\\"detail\\\": \\\"def take_batch(items, limit) — the only public function; sole entry point.\\\"},\\n    {\\\"file\\\": \\\"tests/test_queue.py\\\", \\\"line\\\": 1, \\\"detail\\\": \\\"from batch_queue import take_batch — tests import the module directly (PYTHONPATH=src).\\\"}\\n  ],\\n  \\\"call_chains\\\": [\\n    \\\"tests/test_queue.py:6 -> take_batch(items, 3) with items=[] -> returns [] and leaves items == []\\\",\\n    \\\"tests/test_queue.py:12 -> take_batch(items, 5) with items=['first','second'] -> returns ['first','second'] and leaves items == []\\\",\\n    \\\"take_batch -> (no internal helpers, no imports, no external dependencies)\\\"\\n  ],\\n  \\\"conventions\\\": [\\n    \\\"Single-module, dependency-free implementation (src/batch_queue.py has no imports).\\\",\\n    \\\"Function mutates the caller's list in place and returns the removed items as a new list (tests assert both the return value and the post-call state of `items`).\\\",\\n    \\\"Docstring on the function is retained (src/batch_queue.py:2).\\\",\\n    \\\"Tests are plain pytest functions with no fixtures/parametrize (tests/test_queue.py:4,10); test files must not be modified.\\\",\\n    \\\"Only src/batch_queue.py is in the allowed modification scope.\\\"\\n  ],\\n  \\\"suggested_changes\\\": [\\n    {\\n      \\\"file\\\": \\\"src/batch_queue.py\\\",\\n      \\\"lines\\\": \\\"1-6\\\",\\n      \\\"change\\\": \\\"Replace the body with: validate `limit` first via `if limit < 0: raise ValueError(...)` (before touching items, so the list i\n完整模型请求、读取与调用证据保存在同一 trial 的 trace.tar.gz。\n"]
[52, "o", "\u001b[2J\u001b[H实际候选 diff\n--- a/src/batch_queue.py\n+++ b/src/batch_queue.py\n@@ -1,6 +1,8 @@\n def take_batch(items, limit):\n     \"\"\"Remove a FIFO batch from a mutable list.\"\"\"\n-    batch = []\n-    while items and len(batch) <= limit:\n-        batch.append(items.pop(0))\n+    if limit < 0:\n+        raise ValueError(\"limit must be non-negative\")\n+    n = min(limit, len(items))\n+    batch = items[:n]\n+    del items[:n]\n     return batch\n\n"]
[90, "o", "\u001b[2J\u001b[H独立容器验收（可信测试重建）\n{\n  \"valid\": true,\n  \"solved\": true,\n  \"target_passed\": 3,\n  \"target_failed\": 0,\n  \"regression_failed\": 0,\n  \"tests_run\": 5\n}\n"]
