[124, "o", "\u001b[2J\u001b[H实际最终汇报（checkpoint 有界摘要）\nLangGraph MultiAgent workflow finished: PASSED\n\nPlan: Done: take_batch validates limit first, then slices and deletes at most limit items from the front. Visible tests pass (2 passed) and boundary self-checks pass.\n\nTodos:\n- [completed] Rewrite take_batch in src/batch_queue.py: validate limit<0 (raise ValueError before any mutation), slice at most limit items FIFO, del items[:n], return batch.\n- [completed] Run PYTHONPATH=src:. python -m pytest -q and self-check boundaries (limit=0, limit<0 with empty/non-empty list, drain, empty queue).\n\nResearch sources:\n(none)\n\nVerifier:\nsrc/batch_queue.py 的 take_batch 已正确实现：先校验 limit<0 抛 ValueError（未触碰 items），再用 min(limit,len(items)) 切片并 del items[:n]，FIFO 顺序与剩余顺序均保持；可见测试 2 passed，边界自检全部通过。\n\nChecks:\n- 实现正确性（src/batch_queue.py）: PASS - 文件内容为：if limit < 0: raise ValueError(...); n = min(limit, len(items)); batch = items[:n]; del items[:n]; return batch。校验在任何变更之前，无 off-by-one。\n- 可见测试 PYTHONPATH=src:. python -m pytest -q: PASS - 2 passed in 0.01s，exit=0（test_empty_queue、test_drain_in_fifo_order）。\n- limit=0 不消费: PASS - take_batch(['a','b'],0) 返回 [] 且 items 仍为 ['a','b']。\n- FIFO 部分取出与剩余顺序: PASS - take_batch(['a','b','c'],2)==['a','b']，剩余 ['c']；take_batch(list(range(10)),3)==[0,1,2]，剩余 [3..9] 顺序不变。\n- limit<0 抛 ValueError 且不改列表: PASS - 非空 ['a','b'] 与空列表 [] 均抛 ValueError，调用后列表内容不变。\n- 正常排空与空队列: PASS - take_batch(['a','b'],5)==['a','b'] 且清空；take_batch([],3)==[] 且保持空。\n- 修改范围: PASS - 工作区仅含 README.md、TODO.md、src、tests；测试文件 tests/test_queue.py 未被改动，实现改动限\n"]
[132, "o", "\u001b[2J\u001b[H结论边界\n这是一份正常完成且独立验收通过的候选。\nMokioAgent controlled FIFO queue demonstration; not a benchmark task\n单例演示不替换原架构对照成绩。\n原始失败、基础设施问题和所有预定试验均保留。\n"]
[150, "o", "\u001b[2J\u001b[H回放结束。复现已有产物不会再次请求模型。\n\n"]
